solution:
We can find the value of $a_{2^{100}}$ by repeatedly applying property (ii).
\[a_{2^{100}} = 2^{99} \cdot a_{2^{99}} = 2^{99} \cdot 2^{98} \cdot a_{2^{98}} = \cdots = 2^{99} \cdot 2^{98} \cdots 2^1 \cdot a_1 = 2^{99} \cdot 2^{98} \cdots 2^1 \cdot 1 = 2^{99} \cdot 2^{98} \cdots 2^2 \cdot 2^1 \cdot 1 = 2^{99 + 98 + \cdots + 2 + 1} = 2^{99 \cdot 100/2} = 2^{4950}.\]
Therefore, the value of $a_{2^{100}}$ is $\boxed{2^{4950}}$.The answer is 2^{4950}

